╭ Keys ────────────────────────────────── 4-25 of 25 · j/k scroll · Esc closes ╮
│                        :profile <name>  :draft  :active  :help  :q           │
│?                       this help                                             │
│q / Ctrl-C              quit                                                  │
│↑ ↓ PgUp PgDn Home End  move in the current table                             │
│s                       cycle sort column and direction                       │
│/                       search in the current table (Enter keep, Esc clear)   │
│r                       refresh the current screen (bypasses the cache)       │
│a                       toggle auto-refresh for the current screen            │
│Traffic  v              cycle Flows · App-to-app · Blocked                    │
│Traffic  f              edit filter: window src dst service decisions         │
│Traffic  g              change the aggregate label keys                       │
│Traffic  Enter          detail (flows) · drill into a pair (aggregate)        │
│Policy   d              toggle draft / active                                 │
│Policy   p              pending changes                                       │
│Policy   Tab / Enter    pane · rule detail · on a ruleset: load deny rules    │
│Objects  Tab / Enter    next object type · detail                             │
│Workloads t/T h H Enter Traffic as src/dst · unhealthy · health sort · detail │
│Events   f / Enter / S  filter · event as JSON · sort by severity             │
│n / e / x               new / edit / delete (Objects, Workloads; needs writes)│
│Pending  j/k Enter      select · diff of a pending IP list or service         │
│y / n                   send / cancel a shown request                         │
│Esc                     close overlay / cancel                                │
